alse},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-10-06T07:31:39Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/6023643493","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/3512#issuecomment-6023643493","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3512","id":6023643493,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz888AAAABZwmBZQ","user":{"login":"joscdk","id":2535140,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzUxNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2535140?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk","html_url":"https://github.com/joscdk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T19:14:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T19:14:35Z","body":"@kradalby \n- We hit the same thing on 0.29.3/0.29.4: about 450 nodes, SQLite, a file-mode policy with 5 rules, no via, no groups.\n- Same hot path, but through AutoGroup.Resolve (we use autogroup:member/autogroup:tagged as sources) rather than Group.Resolve/resolveUser. That shows it isn't specific to groups. Any source alias pays it.\n- Profile: 82% of CPU in ViaRoutesForPeer. The host maxed out every weekday, and the write queue backed up.\n- Confirming the reporter's workaround: acls → grants, one per rule, took our 16 effective grants down to 5. That's 3.3× on this path, with an identical compiled filter, which we verified across the whole fleet.\n\nOpened #3536 as a potential fix, but it got rejected by the vouch system. If you agree with the fix, any chance i can be allowed to open it?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/6023643493/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"joscdk","id":2535140,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzUxNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2535140?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk","html_url":"https://github.com/joscdk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joscdk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":32630153101,"node_id":"MEE_lADOEFLz888AAAABT_rK788AAAAHmOifjQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/32630153101","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gis